; Revisions:
; 15 Oct 2025 CTB Added Option to Reset Tool Rack Outputs on Job Start via P419.
;                   Intended for Tool Racks that move out when not energized.
; 05 Sep 2025 CTB Added Delay Timer for AirPressureOk
;                  Intended for systems that may experience a brief drop in pressure during actuation.
; 03 Sep 2025 CTB Added PWM Floor to Analog Logic
; 14 Jul 2025 CTB Added "Smart" Spindle Tool Release Logic.
; 22 Apr 2025 CTB Added SV_SKINNING_DATA_W_1 for Feedrate Control.
; 21 Apr 2025 CTB Added Spindle Scaling via P78 Bit4
; 18 Apr 2025 CTB Added Toggle Skin Events for OUTPUTS1-8
; 27 Nov 2024 CTB Removed Torch Logic that pertains to SV_THC_VELOCITY_XY, as SV_VELOCITY_RATIO now gives
;                 ratio for both AD1 and AD2 Motion (Non-Smoothed and Smoothed Motion)
; 05 Nov 2024 CTB Updated ShuttleXpress Keybindings to eliminate conflicts with Aux13-16 Keyboard bindings.
;                 Shuttle uses Alt key + z,x,c,b,n,g,h instead of ctrl 1-7 for continuous minus jogging.
; 16 Sep 2024 CTB Added Feed Rate Variation (FRV) primarily for use with lathes to stop chip buildup.
; 14 Aug 2024 CTB Added Keyboard Jogging keys to numpad including the diagonal directions.
;                 Added Checks to all Keyboard shortcuts that no other "modifier" key is pressed.
; 06 Aug 2024 CTB Added a Critical Input Check to ensure buttons were not pressed
;                   on startup.
; 30 Jul 2024 CTB Added SV_ESTOP_PRESSED & SV_RESET_PRESSED logic for CNC12.
; 01 Jul 2024 CTB Corrected issue with Spin On/Off Toggle on WMPG not tracking state of spindle correctly.
;                 Added External Usb Spindle Toggle On/Off.
; 17 Jun 2024 CTB Adjusted Keyboard Jogging to require Ctrl to Jog the axes to help prevent accidental
; 05 Jun 2024 CTB Updated X1, X10, X100 Logic to account for non-momentary switches for ExtUSB and WMPG and
;                   are now properly handled. WMPG Overrides ExtUSB, ExtUSB Overrides JogPanel/VCP/Keyboard Keys.
;                 WMPG and/or ExtUSB will now disable JogPanel/VCP/Keyboard X1,X10,X100 Keys when active to prevent
;                   LEDs from "flashing" or other single scan artifacts of X1,X10,X100 Keys.
; 03 Jun 2024 CTB Added MPG Axis Selector Logic for External Usb Devices.
; 28 May 2024 CTB Added Initial Spindle Speed Variation Logic (SSV)
; 09 May 2024 CTB Added Initial USB-BOB Support.
; 29 Apr 2024 CTB SpinSpeedCommand_FW is now properly set to 0 when spindle is Stopped (DoSpindleStop).
; 06 Mar 2024 CTB Added SpindleUpToSpeedState_M to make waiting for Up To Speed signal easier for Macros.
; 21 Feb 2024 CTB Fixed Issues with LimitDefeat. Will now properly cover
;                   all 16 inputs of AcornSix instead of the first 8,
;                   and the first expansion board Inputs 65-80.
; 31 Jan 2024 CTB Added EStopOK2 Input.
; 15 Jan 2024 CTB Added SelectRapidLink and SV_PC_TOGGLE_RAPID_FEED_LINK for Rapid/Feed Link Functionality.
; 11 Dec 2023 CTB Added Invert X Jog Keys for Mill, Z for Lathe.
; 02 Nov 2023 CTB Fixed conflict between WMPG and DoorOpenSlowJog_M.
;                 WMPG will now no longer override SlowJog with Door Open
;                 and will only be allowed X1 and X10.
; 10 Sep 2023 CTB Prevent SpindleCooling_Fan when M37 is active.
; 05 Sep 2023 CTB Added WMPG Functionality to adjust Rapid Override.
; 14 Aug 2023 CTB Added External USB Panel Logic
;                 External Cyclestart, Cyclestop, FeedHold, ToolCheck Buttons.
;                 External Feedrate, Spindle, and Rapid Override Knobs.
; 01 Aug 2023 CTB Added OscillationOn for Tangential Knife Systems
; 27 Jul 2023 CTB Can now change Incr/Cont, Fast/Slow, and/or X1, X10, X100
;                 on Jog Panel with an active WMPG while MPG LED is off.
